 metal type. This ensures that each visitor gets a unique experience and prints a different, personalized card on each visit. Each set consists of a complete word block, carefully chosen to suit your interests or for artistic creation. \n\n**The instructor demonstrates ink rolling.**\nDuring the workshop, our experienced instructor will demonstrate the intricate process of ink rolling, which is a critical part of the printing process. This ensures that every visitor can understand the nuances of this traditional printing technique firsthand, providing an educational and engaging experience.\n\n**Each visitor prints one small card.**\nAs you step into the workshop, you will be greeted by a selection of small, blank cards that are perfect for your printed art. After the instructor shows you the ink roller, you will roll the ink onto your card using the designated roller. Once the card is inked, you can start printing directly onto the surface of the card.\n\n**The drying rack is beside the window.**\nAfter printing your card, it is time to dry it. Each visitor will find a drying rack beside the window. With the drying rack at their disposal, they can leave their card to dry naturally in the sunlight. This not only ensures that the ink dries thoroughly, preserving the vibrant colors and crisp text, but it also allows visitors to enjoy the results of their creative efforts. \n\nThank you for joining us in this unique print workshop experience. Let's start creating beautiful cards together!", "cap": false, "prompt_ids": [151644, 8948, 198, 2610, 525, 1207, 16948, 11, 3465, 553, 54364, 14817, 13, 1446, 525, 264, 10950, 17847, 13, 151645, 198, 151644, 872, 198, 7985, 264, 43388, 20181, 42536, 315, 911, 220, 16, 23, 15, 311, 220, 17, 17, 15, 4244, 911, 264, 1173, 25073, 13, 5443, 1172, 279, 2701, 584, 3255, 369, 14175, 3565, 13, 29734, 1817, 315, 1181, 3040, 22870, 6896, 11, 323, 912, 5390, 16148, 2163, 1105, 13, 3155, 537, 912, 264, 855, 1564, 911, 1493, 11221, 382, 12676,